<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Divine Empowerment / La Fuerza Divina</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Free, bilingual, trauma-informed and evidence-based programs for families and youth across the Valley of the Sun." />
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#0B1B2B" />
  <!-- Social preview (replace /assets/social-card.png when ready) -->
  <meta property="og:title" content="Divine Empowerment / La Fuerza Divina" />
  <meta property="og:description" content="Breaking Chains. Building Strength. Empowering Families. Empoderando Familias / La Fuerza Divina." />
  <meta property="og:image" content="/assets/social-card.png" />
  <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
  <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image" />
  <meta name="twitter:title" content="Divine Empowerment / La Fuerza Divina" />
  <meta name="twitter:description" content="Breaking Chains. Building Strength. Empowering Families. Empoderando Familias / La Fuerza Divina." />
  <meta name="twitter:image" content="/assets/social-card.png" />
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/assets/favicon.png" />
  <style>
    :root {
      --navy:#0B1B2B;
      --gold:#F1B31C;
      --magenta:#C23D83;
      --ink:#0f172a;
      --muted:#475569;
      --bg:#ffffff;
    }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
    body {
      margin:0; font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, Segoe UI, Roboto, Arial, "Noto Sans", "Helvetica Neue", sans-serif;
      color: var(--ink); background: var(--bg);
    }
    .wrap { max-width: 1120px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 16px; }
    header {
      position: sticky; top:0; z-index:50; background: rgba(255,255,255,.92); backdrop-filter: saturate(140%) blur(6px);
      border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    }
    .row { display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:16px; height:64px; }
    nav a { text-decoration:none; color:#334155; margin-left:18px; font-weight:600 }
    nav a:hover { color: var(--gold) }
    .brand { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px; text-decoration:none; color:inherit }
    .brand img { height:40px; width:auto }
    .brand .name { font-weight:800; font-size:20px }
    .btn { display:inline-block; padding:12px 18px; border-radius:999px; font-weight:700; text-decoration:none }
    .btn-primary { background: var(--gold); color: var(--navy); box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(241,179,28,0.35) }
    .btn-outline { border:1px solid #cbd5e1; color:#0f172a }
    .btn:hover { transform: translateY(-1px) }
    .hero { padding: 72px 0; background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(11,27,43,0.06), #fff) }
    h1,h2 { line-height:1.15; margin:0 }
    h1 { font-size: clamp(32px, 5vw, 56px); font-weight: 900; }
    h2 { font-size: clamp(24px, 3.2vw, 36px); font-weight: 800; }
    p.lead { color:#475569; font-size:18px; max-width: 840px }
    section { padding: 64px 0 }
    .cardgrid { display:grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px,1fr)); gap:16px }
    .card { border:1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius:16px; padding:20px; background:#fff; box-shadow: 0 1px 0 rgba(2,6,23,0.04) }
    .quote { font-style: italic; color:#475569; text-align:center; max-width:720px; margin: 24px auto 0 }
    footer { border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0; padding: 32px 0 }
    .footerflex { display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:16px; flex-wrap:wrap }
    .muted { color:#64748b }
    .pill { display:inline-block; padding:6px 10px; border-radius:999px; background: rgba(194,61,131,0.08); color:#7a294f; font-weight:700; font-size:12px }
    .actions { display:flex; gap:12px; flex-wrap:wrap }
    @media (max-width: 640px) { nav { display:none } }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="wrap row">
      <a href="#top" class="brand" aria-label="Divine Empowerment home">
        <img src="/assets/logo-header-192.png" alt="Divine Empowerment – La Fuerza Divina logo" onerror="this.style.display='none'">
        <span class="name">Divine Empowerment <span class="muted">/ La Fuerza Divina</span></span>
      </a>
      <nav>
        <a href="#about">About</a>
        <a href="#values">Values</a>
        <a href="#programs">Programs</a>
        <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://www.paypal.com/donate/?hosted_button_id=5U8498DUAPHDQ" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Donate</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main id="top">
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="wrap" style="text-align:center">
        <h1>From Within, We Rise — Empowering Families and Building Hope.</h1>
        <p class="lead" style="margin:16px auto 28px">
          Divine Empowerment is a grassroots nonprofit in Phoenix, Arizona — serving families all throughout the Valley of the Sun,
          offering free, bilingual, trauma-informed and evidence-based programs that uplift families, youth, and caregivers through healing,
          prevention, and empowerment.
        </p>
        <div class="actions" style="justify-content:center">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#programs">Explore Programs</a>
          <a class="btn btn-outline" href="https://www.paypal.com/donate/?hosted_button_id=5U8498DUAPHDQ" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Donate</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="about">
      <div class="wrap" style="display:grid; grid-template-columns: 1.2fr .8fr; gap:24px">
        <div>
          <h2>About Divine Empowerment / La Fuerza Divina</h2>
          <p class="lead" style="margin-top:12px">
            Founded by a community advocate who turned lived experience into purpose, Divine Empowerment helps families rebuild their lives
            through education, resilience, and cultural pride. We believe every person deserves dignity, healing, and the power to rise again.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="card" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(247,201,72,0.22), rgba(194,61,131,0.12))">
          <p style="text-align:center; font-weight:700">“Breaking Chains. Building Strength. Empowering Families.”</p>
          <div style="text-align:center; margin-top:8px"><span class="pill">Trauma-informed • Evidence-based</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="values" style="background:#f8fafc">
      <div class="wrap">
        <h2 style="text-align:center">Our Core Values</h2>
        <div class="cardgrid" style="margin-top:18px">
          <div class="card"><h3>Integrity & Purpose</h3><p class="muted">We lead with transparency, compassion, and commitment to our mission.</p></div>
          <div class="card"><h3>Healing & Growth</h3><p class="muted">We use trauma-informed and evidence-based approaches to restore hope and stability.</p></div>
          <div class="card"><h3>Family & Culture</h3><p class="muted">We honor cultural roots, family unity, and intergenerational healing.</p></div>
          <div class="card"><h3>Empowerment & Equity</h3><p class="muted">We stand for justice, opportunity, and community leadership.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="programs">
      <div class="wrap">
        <h2 style="text-align:center">Community Impact & Services</h2>
        <p class="lead" style="text-align:center; margin:14px auto 28px">
          Even without external funding, Divine Empowerment provides free, culturally rooted, trauma-informed, and evidence-based services
          across Phoenix and the Valley of the Sun. We collaborate with local organizations to make prevention, healing, and empowerment accessible to all.
        </p>
        <div class="cardgrid">
          <div class="card"><h3>Parenting & Prevention</h3><p class="muted">Workshops that strengthen families, teach prevention, and build protective factors.</p></div>
          <div class="card"><h3>Youth Mentoring & Healing Circles</h3><p class="muted">Safe spaces for youth to grow resilience, share experiences, and receive trauma-informed support.</p></div>
          <div class="card"><h3>Family Drug Education</h3><p class="muted">Community education to prevent substance misuse and encourage open family communication.</p></div>
          <div class="card"><h3>Foster Youth & Caregiver Support</h3><p class="muted">Guided prevention and mentoring for current and former foster youth and caregivers.</p></div>
          <div class="card"><h3>Child Well-Being & Safety</h3><p class="muted">Resources and advocacy to help prevent child abuse and strengthen protective family bonds.</p></div>
          <div class="card"><h3>Domestic & Sexual Violence Awareness</h3><p class="muted">Education and support with community leaders to create safer families.</p></div>
        </div>
        <p class="quote">“This work is personal. Compassion, knowledge, and resilience can heal generations. We rise together to build stronger, safer, more empowered communities.”</p>
        <div style="text-align:center; margin-top:26px">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://www.paypal.com/donate/?hosted_button_id=5U8498DUAPHDQ" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Donate to Support Free Programs</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="contact" style="background:#f8fafc">
      <div class="wrap" style="display:grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap:24px">
        <div>
          <h2>Contact Us</h2>
          <p class="muted" style="margin-top:10px">Have questions, want to collaborate, or need services? Get in touch — we’d love to hear from you.</p>
          <ul style="list-style:none; padding:0; margin-top:12px; color:#334155; line-height:1.9">
            <li><strong>Phone:</strong> (480) 297-9340</li>
            <li><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:divineempowermentorg@gmail.com">divineempowermentorg@gmail.com</a></li>
            <li><strong>Location:</strong> Phoenix, Arizona — serving families all throughout the Valley of the Sun</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <form class="card">
          <label style="display:block; font-size:14px; font-weight:600; margin-bottom:6px">Name
            <input type="text" style="margin-top:6px; width:100%; padding:12px; border-radius:12px; border:1px solid #cbd5e1" placeholder="Your name" />
          </label>
          <label style="display:block; font-size:14px; font-weight:600; margin:12px 0 6px">Email
            <input type="email" style="margin-top:6px; width:100%; padding:12px; border-radius:12px; border:1px solid #cbd5e1" placeholder="you@example.org" />
          </label>
          <label style="display:block; font-size:14px; font-weight:600; margin:12px 0 6px">Message
            <textarea rows="5" style="margin-top:6px; width:100%; padding:12px; border-radius:12px; border:1px solid #cbd5e1" placeholder="How can we help?"></textarea>
          </label>
          <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline" onclick="window.location='mailto:divineempowermentorg@gmail.com'">Send Message</button>
        </form>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <div class="wrap footerflex">
      <div style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px">
        <img src="/assets/logo-512.png" alt="Divine Empowerment logo" style="height:40px; width:auto" onerror="this.style.display='none'">
        <p class="muted">© 2025 Divine Empowerment / La Fuerza Divina. Built on evidence-based practice, cultural pride, and community strength.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="actions">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://www.paypal.com/donate/?hosted_button_id=5U8498DUAPHDQ" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Donate</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
